> ### Name: haldane_map
> ### Title: Haldane Mapping Function
> ### Aliases: haldane_map haldane_mapping_function
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> # Convert 0.1 Morgan (10 cM) to recombination fraction
> haldane_map(0.1)
[1] 0.09063462
> 
> # Convert 0.5 Morgan (50 cM) to recombination fraction  
> haldane_map(0.5)
[1] 0.3160603
> 
> # Convert 1.0 Morgan (100 cM) to recombination fraction
> haldane_map(1.0)
[1] 0.4323324
> 
